    ],
    "text": "Description of the land: A Portion of land called Meeriyakelle bearing in total Extent of 0.379 Hectare, Shown as Lot No. 270 of the Plan No. F.V.P.2A, Sheet 11 and 20.02.2000 dated, Surveyed and prepared by the Surveyor General of Badulla District, situated in Maduragama Grama Niladhari\u2019s division of Gotuwela Village of Meeriyakelle in the minor Division of Kumbalwela Korle in the Divisional Secretariat division of Ella in Badulla District, Uva - Province and Bounded as Follows.",
