      678.49,
      286.45,
      724.08
    ],
    "text": "North by: Lot No. 7a. Pattiyakumbura and Lot No. 46; East by: Lot No. 46, 202, 207, 208, 209 and 220; South by: Lot No. 208, 209, 220 and 46A; West by: Lot No. 7A Pattiyakumbura.",
