      411.3
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in above land on which a Servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Ella Divisional Secretariat on the 29th of April, 2015 at 10.00 a.m.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
